#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:178
msgid "&Sharing"
msgstr "deeling"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:270
msgid ""
"<p>To share files via the web, you need to be running an 'applet' in your "
"KDE panel. This 'applet' is a small program which provides file sharing "
"capabilities.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>aan deel lêers deur middel van die web, jy benodig aan wees wat loop 'n "
"'applet' in jou kde paneel. hierdie 'applet' is 'n klein program wat verskaf "
"lêer deeling instaad tot.</p>"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:280
msgid "Start Applet"
msgstr "begin miniprogram"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:287 PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:526
msgid "Applet status: <strong>not running</strong>"
msgstr "miniprogram status: <strong>nie wat loop</strong>"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:309
msgid "Share this directory on the &web"
msgstr "deel hierdie gids op die web"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:311
msgid "&Listen port"
msgstr "luister poort"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:312
msgid "&Bandwidth limit"
msgstr "bandwydte beperk"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:328
msgid "kB/s"
msgstr "kb/s"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:355
msgid ""
"<p>Setting this option makes all files in this directory and any "
"subdirectories available for reading to anyone who wishes to view "
"them.</p>"
"<p>To view your files, a web browser or similar program may be "
"used.</p>"
"<p><strong>Warning!</strong> Before sharing a directory, you should be sure "
"that it does not contain sensitive information, such as passwords, company "
"secrets, your addressbook, etc.</p>"
"<p>Note that you cannot share your home directory (%1)</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>opset hierdie opsie maak alle lêers in hierdie gids en enige sub-gidse "
"beskikbaar vir lees aan enige iemand wie wense aan besigtig hulle.</p>"
"<p>aan besigtig jou lêers, 'n web blaaier of soortgelyk program dalk mag "
"wees gebruik word.</p>"
"<p><strong>waarskuwing!</strong> voor deeling 'n gids, jy moet wees seker "
"wat dit doen nie bevat sensitief informasie, soos as wagwoorde, maatskappy "
"geheime, jou adresboek, etc.</p>"
"<p>nota wat jy kan nie deel jou huis gids (%1)</p>"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:411
msgid ""
"<p>Allow serving of files which have a symbolic link in the path from / to "
"the file, or are a symbolic link themselves.</p>"
"<p><strong>Warning!</strong> This could be a security risk. Use only if you "
"understand the issues involved.</p>"
msgstr ""

